    section: "B", questionRef: "2018 HL Q8(b)",
    questionText: "Answer the following questions in relation to an activity that you carried out to investigate the influence of light intensity or carbon dioxide concentration on the rate of photosynthesis. (b)(i) Name the plant you used for this investigation. (b)(ii) Give a reason for using this plant. (b)(iii) How did you measure the rate of photosynthesis? (b)(iv) Label the axes below, and sketch a graph to show how the rate of photosynthesis would change as your chosen factor varied over a wide range. (b)(v) Explain the shape of your graph.",
    tariffModel: {"kind":"questionTotal"}, totalMarks: 24,
