    section: "C", questionRef: "2018 HL Q11(b)",
    questionText: "2. State the precise location and describe the role of the atrioventricular (AV) node. (b)(i) Draw a diagram to show the structure of the human heart and associated blood vessels, labelling each of the following: Vena cava; tricuspid valve; aorta; left ventricle; semi‐lunar valve; pulmonary artery. (b)(ii) ⁣1. State the precise location and describe the role of the sinoatrial (SA) node. (b)(iii) What exactly is being measured when a person’s blood pressure is taken? (27)",
